cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "NigerDelta HSSE Tracker"
abstract: >-
  A free, offline-capable Progressive Web Application enabling Niger Delta
  residents to report oil spills, gas flares, and environmental health
  incidents, and to track regulatory response and estimated methane
  emissions. Device-local architecture: reports are stored on the
  reporting device only, with no server and no automatic sync.
